{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "099c4c856aed2a62ef73d2b035459d59c37a8ecefc0fab88f9260d229c8dd85e", "ja": "大きな輪になって", "zh": "围成一个大圈", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f1271aa098edd944a7d303d8fc4303e83e1dcf06342c23abcca29a49c843e715", "ja": "地方ツアーの振り返りをテーマにした取材の\n帰り道。ツアーが終わったのにまたツアーが\n始まるのは、ぐるっと回って全部繋がってい\nるみたい、大きな円陣を組んでいるようだと\n語り、モチベーションを高めるアイドル達。", "zh": "在以回顾地方巡演为主题的采访结束后，\n偶像们踏上了归途。巡演明明才刚结束，却又\n迎来了新的巡演，大家聊着这就像是转了一圈\n全都连在了一起，像是在围成一个巨大的圆阵，\n由此更加干劲十足。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4b576ee3f4ef004d915663d8f7330a438bded59bc81898da8fcd8c220836dc6a", "ja": "（首都エリアでのツアーに先駆け、地方ツアーに\nついて振り返る、という内容での取材があった）", "zh": "（在首都地区巡演开始前，接受了一次以回顾地方巡演为主题的采访。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_04_1001_p", "source_sha256": "3bc67d33034b6aa66dd76d1e5a58bfa176f957e8b92818c7cb7727dd2edd5e1e", "ja": "（思えば、いろんな事があったな……）", "zh": "（现在想想，真是发生了好多事啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_04_1002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "0022d95d8250c2adb1a2e1a84a35124a8260dc23b2a57f0ab1efd6ce5e86f6e1", "ja": "ふぅ……。取材、たくさんお話できてよかったね。\nそれに、今日だけでずいぶん移動をしたかも……。", "zh": "呼……采访时能聊这么多，真是太好了。\n而且，光是今天就跑了好多地方……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_04_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "14ad834c0d55936c2a81481a7023ee23754421f0c7729baac8a64d7602705657", "ja": "せやな。私ら、ずっと走り続けてる気ぃするわ。\nこれなら首都エリアでも、うまくいきそうやんな♪", "zh": "是啊。感觉我们一直在不停奔波呢。\n这样一来，就算是在首都地区，应该也能顺利进行吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_04_1004_p", "source_sha256": "f20336012a2161eb80f1cc9720c015b7d350c5a375355bda1a828c5de639b51d", "ja": "そうか、みんな疲れてもいないのか。\n若いっていいな……。", "zh": "这样啊，大家都还没觉得累吗。\n年轻真好啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_04_1005_004yuk", "source_sha256": "7c91a3585627d859f715df5134b956dba0e77cd0bb6d68d256bae6380bf04d43", "ja": "{$P$}、\nなんだか、おじさんみたいですぅ……。", "zh": "{$P$}，感觉就像大叔一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_04_1006_p", "source_sha256": "2f162d1ff3e20b7f5e54a51a51a496796067a3ffa4c03658a4b80ef192d349a8", "ja": "うっ……。", "zh": "呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
