{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_04_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "a563fd690dd281af86f2d07caa12e5db5818eff85cc660a38a205ded9e74fb4e", "ja": "ツアーが終わったのに、またツアーがあって。\n最後にまた公演だなんて、なんだか不思議です！", "zh": "明明巡演已经结束了，却又有新的巡演。最后居然又要演出，总觉得有点不可思议呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_04_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "3b296df82e711f920902dd9c79d563cd3a3e5cf3a468076be414f276cf92fc15", "ja": "うん。\nぐるっと回って、全部繋がってるみたいだね。", "zh": "嗯。兜兜转转，感觉这一切好像都连接在一起了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_04_1014_025roc", "source_sha256": "e5cc70d548801fc437b44263645ff8fe054452d62528fe1f152b6fe8e7f54f61", "ja": "そうですよ！　ロコ達のしてきたことは、全部\n繋がっているんです。ね、{$P$}？", "zh": "没错！ROCO们所做的一切，全都紧紧相连。对吧，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_04_1015_p", "source_sha256": "99120742cdd19eb69b7c56d978f45d927c3d4da6453867ee60d58cb28f527f4b", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。ひとつひとつ繋いだ結果、\nきれいな円ができたみたいだ。", "zh": "啊，没错。一个个连接起来之后，似乎就形成了一个漂亮的圆。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_04_1016_037nao", "source_sha256": "a4d0ee1750c8defa3bed9d23ab8cca628b3ce178e8ee1068d521967e05c48d8e", "ja": "円かぁ。ってことは、円陣もなんかな？\nみんなで繋いでるし！", "zh": "是圆啊。既然这样，圆阵是不是也算呢？\n毕竟大家都连在一起嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_04_1017_p", "source_sha256": "b30b08ec5ad101907cde23303fe287b2ea26688a9e4e0f9f9d1718068ab59a2e", "ja": "なるほど。そんな気もするな。", "zh": "原来如此。好像确实是这么回事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_04_1018_022ser", "source_sha256": "a1f6d6c1a847e019274ea1c5b660fd69351821a3b921edddd0b2dbbb0840ef82", "ja": "円陣って、元気が出ますよね！　みんなと\n手を重ね合わせて……わたし、大好きです。", "zh": "围成一圈互相搭手，很能让人打起精神呢！和大家一起把手叠在一起……我最喜欢了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_04_1019_004yuk", "source_sha256": "0ec8c5ae29c9aa0e00c27629e6273094fbc31313baaada2387322bfccaf2fe8e", "ja": "うん、私も。\n……すごく、勇気をもらえるよね。", "zh": "嗯，我也是。\n……真的能从中获得勇气呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_04_1020_p", "source_sha256": "c727eb5b9d071c74c225f475e276eb4846a3b117e3e7fd41e432ed7500b2a188", "ja": "地方ツアーで、みんなは本当に大きな円陣を組めた事に\nなる。つまり、今まで以上に気合い十分だな！", "zh": "通过巡演，大家就相当于围成了一个真正巨大的圆阵。也就是说，比以往任何时候都更有干劲了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_04_1021_037nao", "source_sha256": "f61d9762b8dc1cfe17109d728e759f4f6ade1782267f2a4a167fb63ee838d8e0", "ja": "もっちろん！　よーし、やったるでー！\nクルクル回って、星になったるわー！", "zh": "那当然啦！好～看我的吧——！\n我要转啊转地转成一颗星星——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_04_1022_022ser", "source_sha256": "0b4bb0e5d131a02e9e3f1e924e7fe185cedfdc928c499c51622c36f824b99b75", "ja": "あっ、奈緒さん！　わたしも、星になりたいですっ！\n……ここにいる、みんなといっしょに！", "zh": "啊，奈绪小姐！我也想变成星星！\n……和这里的大家一起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_04_1023_p", "source_sha256": "145025c7ec86c508135c062962bbf860119923d6b929ca9cbeca438c58bc2f87", "ja": "（みんな、キラキラしている。\nみんなに遅れをとっちゃいけない……）", "zh": "（大家都在闪闪发光。我可不能落在大家后面……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0259_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_04_1024_p", "source_sha256": "86cd25640506c74473cb1f830488e3309c65dbb8682eab1903cedd8e991be3e3", "ja": "（さあ、次のステップへ。\nアイドル達は、止まらないぞ！）", "zh": "（好了，迈向下一个阶段。\n偶像们可不会停下脚步！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
